WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.120
Someone once said...

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.920
There are puffer fish so delicious, if 
you eat one, you can't stop smiling.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:02:00.760
And they've got funny, mixed-up faces too...

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:04.500
Puffunny Fish!

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.370
They're sweet and full of vitamin C,

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:11.870
but if you eat them, you won't stop sneezing.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:16.880
And these odd tangerines sneeze themselves...

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:20.010
Tangersneezes!

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:32.530
Bless you.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:36.560
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:41.670
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.280
How is the boss's appetite?

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:59.150
It seems to have increased 
compared to before.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.720
Yes.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.520
But we need to procure more 
delicious ingredients.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.690
Even the treasure of Chowlin 
Temple, Bubble Fruit,

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:11.200
didn't satisfy the boss's appetite.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.600
Well, Yuu?

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:17.040
Have you gotten hold of any clues...

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.870
...regarding Acacia's menu?

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:21.340
I have.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.010
That's why I'm here, to report on it.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.180
We have eyewitness information 
on what's been called

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.150
the key to discovering his menu... Infinibee.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.820
Infinibee...

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:41.330
The legendary bee that's said to 
lead to Acacia's special menu?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:47.400
Bees that seek out light appear in 
the land that's as golden as the sun.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.140
While I was investigating that legend,

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:56.040
it became clear that they were 
slipping into the Human World.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.480
Then it's apparently true that 
they can go back and forth freely

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.850
between the Gourmet World 
and the Human World.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.620
Capture them at once.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.850
For the boss... For Midora-sama's sake.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.020
Leave it to me, Al-sama.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:17.290
I stake the prestige of the information 
gathering team of Branch #2 on it.

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.160
I will definitely succeed.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.070
You're a Branch Chief.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.500
Yet you're going to move on this yourself?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.340
Yes.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.640
I've already come up with a plan.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:40.480
I'm sure you'll be able to make 
good use of this, Yuu-sama.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:50.560
Legendary Bee, Infinibee! 
Toriko vs New-style GT Robot!

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.970
Garlicow Steak!

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.940
Beef that tastes like garlic!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.940
Garlicow!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.870
Thank you for the food!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:15.180
The aromatic garlic scent is risin' up!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.620
It's even more explosive 
when I put it in my mouth!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.060
I can't get enough of this garlic flavor!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.630
Delicious! It's delicious, Komatsu!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.700
Thank you!

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.170
Even though it's a difficult 
ingredient to cook,

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.040
this is somethin' else!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.610
This has gotta be the result of your 
Honoring the Food training too!

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.510
Right...

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:46.810
It's Setsunon!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.550
Setsunon in the flesh!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.050
Setsu live!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.720
That's the National Gourmet 
Treasure, Setsuno!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.250
She's smaller in person.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.360
Setsuno-san!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.490
Long time no see, Toriko and Komatsu-kun!

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.400
Yeah! So, what can we do for you?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:06.830
What?

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.200
I just heard you two 
mastered Honoring the Food

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.110
and thought I'd see it for myself.

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.670
It seems that the rumor's true.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.080
You can tell just by looking at us?

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.650
Of course!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:24.320
Just from the way you look, 
it comes at me loud and clear.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.720
Well, after all...

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:27.620
We really did work hard on it, right?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:29.620
Yeah...

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.860
Certainly,

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.460
Komatsu-kun's cooking is wonderful too.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:40.100
Yeah. Rocket Tuna Bowl, Mammoth Beef Bowl,

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.740
and the boiled Macaroni 
Seaweed is delicious too!

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:49.470
Giga Crispy Lettuce, Silky Sausage, 
and Blast-off Eggplant...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.740
All ingredients that are 
difficult to cook with, but...

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.080
What's wrong?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.050
Oh, that's right!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:03.990
Since you two have mastered 
Honoring the Food,

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.690
I thought maybe you could help me out.

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:14.330
An order from Setsuno, a 
National Gourmet Treasure...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.730
And the ingredient is All-Noodles!

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.970
Um, what are All-Noodles?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.770
Granny Setsu's special noodles.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.180
It's got everything from 
ramen to udon to pasta in it.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:30.010
The deliciousness of every 
kind of noodle put together.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:35.220
They're incredible noodles 
that appeal to everyone,

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:38.960
men and women, from children to the elderly.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.860
All-Noodles Shop

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:43.090
Granny Setsu's restaurant chain was mobile,

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:46.100
and only operated for a 
very short period of time.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.770
So they're also called "Phantom Noodles".

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.600
Phantom Noodles... All-Noodles...

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.040
I hadn't heard of them.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.780
That's because we were in the Gourmet 
Pyramid when they were being sold.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.540
I only know about it through rumors.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.080
But I really wanted to try it!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.780
Me too!

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:11.950
A fellow wholesaler got to eat it 
and he's still bragging about it!

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:16.090
So this time I'll do all 
I can to help you guys.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:17.490
For the All-Noodles!

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:22.760
Right...

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:34.180
Gastro Gig

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.400
So for the All-Noodles,

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.640
we need to get an ingredient, right?

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:34.140
Yep. It's a special kind of wheat. 
We have to capture Golden Wheat.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.150
Since it's Setsuno-san 
who's made the request,

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.220
I guess it'll be really difficult to get?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.220
Probably.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:47.960
I hear that Golden Wheat is a Super 
Special Preparation Ingredient.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.990
So you should mentally prepare yourself.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:54.960
In the end, is this a special training 
ingredient assigned by Granny Setsu?

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:58.630
It is perfect timing for us to 
test our Honoring the Food power.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:08:59.800
Yeah...

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.230
Hey, come on.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:06.970
What's with you? Every time I mention 
Honoring the Food, you get all gloomy.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.510
Um...

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:12.550
Will I be okay?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.650
What do you mean?

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.620
I was finally able to easily 
prepare a Puffer Whale

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:22.420
and was able to touch the 
training Bubble Fruit.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.890
But it's not like I captured 
the genuine Bubble Fruit

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.560
or even cooked with it, right?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.360
Well, true...

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:36.770
Unlike you, I don't have the feeling 
that I really accomplished something.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:37.440
Besides that...

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:42.670
...compared to the awesomeness of Vanishing 
Japanese Cuisine's Chiru-san...

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:47.780
...I just feel kind of insecure.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.180
Well, anyway,

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.250
let's get what we came for.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.090
After all, it's a request from Granny Setsu.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.830
If we succeed,

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.360
I'm sure there'll be somethin' 
good waitin' for us.

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:04.800
Right?

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:05.760
Right!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:13.400
According to Granny Setsu, the Golden 
Wheat is supposed to grow around here.

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.640
Actually, this is totally different from 
the dangerous areas we usually go to.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.880
It's peaceful here.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.680
Is this really the place?

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.110
Definitely. This area of the sea.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:28.890
Then maybe it's hidden or something?!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.560
Like the Sycnomore Wood at Chowlin Temple...

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.120
It is a request from Setsuno-san!

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:37.390
It just has to be tough to find!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.760
I see...

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.470
Well, since we're not alone here...

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.900
Hey! Do you know anything 
about Golden Wheat?!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.270
You asked a local fisherman!

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.640
There's no way we'd be able 
to find it that easily...

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:56.180
Sure! It's on that island!

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.180
We found it just like that!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.020
And it's right out in the open!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.650
It's gotta stand out!

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:08.460
That island is called the 
"Natural Lighthouse".

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.930
It's indispensable to us fishermen.

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:14.800
Well, I'm glad I asked!

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:19.430
I never imagined we'd find the 
ingredient we were after so quickly!

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:22.400
Isn't this the fastest we've 
ever found an ingredient?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.640
A natural wheat field!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.610
And it's even brighter up close!

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:31.950
I can't look at it directly!

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:35.020
I bet you can get a suntan from this wheat!

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.250
Right!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.950
This wheat will turn our 
skin the color of wheat!

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:43.990
I bet carotene is what makes it so shiny!

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.690
Carotene is a yellow pigment

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:50.200
and is found in the petals 
of sunflowers and marigolds.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.970
It blocks the sun's ultraviolet rays,

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.740
thereby protecting the flower's seeds.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.940
This glow goes beyond 
yellow to a golden color!

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.610
Just how delicious is the 
stuff it's protecting?!

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.610
It's even brighter than Jewel Meat

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:06.380
and Shining Gourami!

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.850
I see!

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:12.120
It's hard to capture because 
of this brightness!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:15.420
Fitting for an ingredient 
ordered by Setsuno-san.

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:18.530
Nope. It's easy if you just wear shades!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.500
Give 'em back! Please give 'em back to me!

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.500
Certainly, we should put the heads 
of grain of this Golden Wheat

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.270
into a Gourmet Case.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.510
R-Right.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.740
But is it okay?

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:38.140
I mean, to capture something so easily?

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:42.850
Yeah, I seem to be unconsciously reluctant. 
My hands aren't goin' to grab 'em.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.950
It's fine! You can capture them!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:49.090
You guys are paralyzed 'cause all the 
ingredients 'til now have been an ordeal.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.930
Toriko-san?

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:57.000
Hey!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.730
This is... Go back to the boat!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.730
What's this about?!

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.600
I smell somethin' dangerous.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.040
Take this and go.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.040
But...

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.070
Hurry up and get outta here, Komatsu!

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.610
Okay!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.190
A GT Robot!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.330
Gourmet Hunter Toriko...

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.260
I never thought I'd meet you here.

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.530
Who's the operator?!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.500
What good would knowing do?

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.170
I'd tell you,

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.540
but I'm in a hurry.

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.710
I’m too busy to attend to you.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.450
You're after this ingredient too?!

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.220
Don't tell me...

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:56.320
We don't need an ingredient like <i>this</i>!

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.470
Toriko-san!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.080
Toriko-san!

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:26.880
Hey!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:31.890
That attack wasn't aimed at me.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.960
You targeted the Golden Wheat.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.530
Right?

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.330
What can I say?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.430
I'm looking for something, you see.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:42.760
I did that as part of my search.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.670
Thank goodness! He's safe!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.740
That's terrible! How cruel!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.310
That was necessary?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.020
It was necessary to blow up Golden Wheat?!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:07.860
The prey I'm after glows 
as bright as the sun.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.720
It's fond of light energy.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:16.300
Apparently, it blends in with 
this natural wheat field.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:17.630
Therefore...

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.700
...I'm trying to bring it out into the open.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.240
You're willing to do anything 
to get what you're after.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:27.640
As always, you rub me the 
wrong way, Gourmet Corp.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.640
And what are you going to do about it?

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.210
Beat the crap outta you!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.380
You leave me no choice.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:37.650
Who would've guessed? A new type of GT Robot,

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:39.520
and its first prey...

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:41.990
...Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.170
Optical camouflage.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:01.670
I can blend in with the surrounding scenery.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.010
Mimesis...

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:05.110
Just like a chameleon!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.450
This robotic body...

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:12.620
Its touch sensors are amazing.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.250
I can feel everything.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:17.960
The sensation of your meat cracking...

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.590
Its sensitivity is incredible.

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.760
Well?

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.830
What do you think of the 
new type of GT Robot?

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.970
It's like you got a cool toy.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.970
I'll tell you one thing though.

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.070
I'm in a hurry too.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:37.340
I'm starvin', see?

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.350
I wanna hurry up and eat All-Noodles!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.950
I ain't got time to play 
with you and your toy!

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:48.750
It seems we share the same opinion.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.190
Then let's get this settled quickly.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:59.530
That's our Yuu-sama.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:03.500
Even in Gourmet Corp, he's first or second 
best with using GT Robots to fight.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.270
He's mastered it already.

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:08.270
The new type...

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:14.340
Mimesis and speed...

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.180
I guess avoidance capability 
is its biggest appeal?

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.650
Then how about this?!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:20.950
Flying Fork!

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.390
That was fast.

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:32.360
I didn't have time to dodge it.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.830
Is that Honoring the Food?

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.430
And yet, this GT Robot 
doesn't have a scratch.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.010
The robot's armor is a new alloy

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:45.570
made of titanium and the shell of an Orichal,

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.540
known to be a hard substance 
even in the Gourmet World.

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.810
So if that attack was the best you can do...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.580
Well, then this robot puts 
Honoring the Food in the shade.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.450
Flying Fork!

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.490
I already told you.

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.090
That doesn't work.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:05.890
Fork! Fork! Fork! Fork! Fork!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:06.860
Fork!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:10.970
What?!

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:13.770
Your armor can probably take it.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:16.370
But the sense of excessive pressure...

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:21.340
Apparently, the operator doesn't 
feel pain when the robot's damaged,

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.480
but the shock should be gettin' through!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.780
You did say it was very 
sensitive, didn't you?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.420
Mimesis again?

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.290
Knife!

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:46.200
How did you know?

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.400
Even if I can't see you,

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.970
my nose knows

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:53.840
the smell of that alloy.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.380
Very impressive, Toriko.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:00.150
Knife doesn't have any effect either?

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.380
It seems you've gotten stronger,

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.450
beyond comparison to that last time.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:06.990
Last time?

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.020
I've seen you once before.

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.260
In Ice Hell...

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.500
At the time, I was using 
a miniature GT Robot.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:20.100
I owe you my thanks for the Century Soup.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:21.600
You mean you were...

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:22.770
That's right.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:25.140
The one who knocked your friend for a loop

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.270
and took the soup.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:31.080
You did that to Komatsu?!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.780
The members of Gourmet 
Corp who drank the soup...

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:39.380
The level of their Gourmet Cells rose 
and they entered the Gourmet World!

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:42.850
It's all thanks to you and your friend!

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.990
It's an obvious trick.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:51.630
You want to provoke me, 
make me lose my composure,

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.370
but it ain't gonna work.

00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:56.830
Was it that blatant?

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:00.200
Actually, I'm full of gratitude.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.140
I never thought I'd get to meet you again.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:07.380
I've gotta be grateful. After all, 
now I can pay you back for that time.

00:20:11.110 --> 00:20:12.380
That's it!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.090
I'll gather the Golden Wheat...

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.620
Joe Joe...

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.990
Let's go with full power.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.760
But it's still a prototype...

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.960
If you generate more 
power than you are now...

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.630
I'll handle it.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:28.570
Leave it to me!

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.270
B-But...

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.030
Joe Joe!

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:32.600
Y-Yes, sir.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.170
As you wish.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.670
Telexistence mode...

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:38.540
...boost!

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:43.910
I'm going to let loose, Toriko!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.050
Anytime you're ready!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:49.120
I'll turn your prized "new 
type" into scrap metal!

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.890
I'll show you...

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.860
...Honoring the Food!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.900
I have been alone

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.070
Ever since that day

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:23.480
All I got was a definite history

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:30.120
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:33.590
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:37.060
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.930
A dream is still a dream

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:44.470
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:48.240
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:52.210
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:59.450
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:05.960
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:10.360
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:17.670
Hiding Level 85

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:13.930
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is a crazy 85!

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.640
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:17.670
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:21.540
It looks like Toriko and friends 
are enjoying a barbecue,

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:23.310
but where could Yun be?

00:22:23.310 --> 00:22:28.580
The Hiding Level is 85, so that's 
a heaping helping of hard!

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:29.950
Yun is...

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:31.250
...right here!

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:35.250
He was a constellation!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.220
Is that even allowed?!

00:22:37.820 --> 00:22:41.590
Yeah, that was a fiendishly 
tough Hiding Level 85!

00:22:42.390 --> 00:22:44.700
Next time is the conclusion 
to the GT Robot battle!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:46.260
How will the showdown end?

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:50.100
Will Toriko and Komatsu-kun be 
able to capture the Golden Wheat?!

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:54.340
A true master is capable of brand new tastes!

00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:56.890
Komatsu-kun, your food is the best!

00:22:57.380 --> 00:23:01.880
Showing His True Ability! A Taste of Komatsu's 
Honoring the Food! The "Phantom Noodles", All-Noodles!

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:04.040
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
